PROJECT CONSTITUTION, WEBSITE RELIABILITY & SELF-SERVICE RECOVERY STANDARD

Document status: Proposed master standard for adoption
Project: Mwangaza Hardware website, digital marketing, customer support, sales and future commission management
Project owner: To be confirmed by the business owner
Marketing agency: To be confirmed in a written agreement
Source of truth: GitHub repository "mwangaza-hardware-demo"
