11.3 WhatsApp

A click-to-chat link is not the same as automated WhatsApp messaging.

Before enabling automation, verify the official account, provider, message fees, templates, user-consent requirements, webhook security, account eligibility and human handoff.

Do not activate paid messaging without approval of the estimated recurring and usage-based costs.

12. MARKETING AND SALES ATTRIBUTION

